      "text": "Full video on YouTube- This week on Worldwide Wednesday, the Indo-Pacific is basically running a daily pressure schedule: China ramps up patrols at Scarborough Shoal, the U.S. and Philippines sail together in contested waters, Taiwan broadcasts rapid-response F-16V readiness and hits a huge milestone with its domestically built submarine’s first undersea trial, while North Korea launches missiles and signals more nuclear-deterrent plans. Meanwhile, ASEAN tries to hold regional unity, Thailand’s election politics heats up after deadly border clashes, and the EU designates the IRGC as a terrorist organization—triggering immediate retaliation threats.\n\nWhat we cover in this episode (10 topics)\n 1. China naval + air patrols around Scarborough Shoal (South China Sea flashpoint)\n 2. U.S.–Philippines joint sail/drill near Scarborough (alliance deterrence signaling)\n 3. Taiwan rapid-response F-16V scramble drill (readiness + sustainment)\n 4. Taiwan submarine first undersea trial (big deterrence milestone)\n 5. North Korea launches short-range ballistic missiles\n 6. Kim signals next-stage “nuclear war deterrent” plan ahead of party congress\n 7. China Coast Guard patrols near Senkaku/Diaoyu “almost daily” (East China Sea pressure)\n 8. ASEAN foreign ministers meeting (South China Sea + Myanmar pressure)\n 9. Thailand election nationalism rises after deadly Cambodia border clashes\n 10. EU lists the IRGC as a terrorist organization + Iran threatens retaliation\n\nSupport the channel (official links)\n\nGo to https://t.co/XNNlRtWAl2\n • Apparel & merch fulfilled by Ranger Up (veteran-rooted, long-running partner)\n • People are stealing my designs — the only place to get official merch is through the link on my website\n • Members-only section with an exclusive store (20% off) + extra perks + exclusive content\n • Members vote on my classic car build — winner gets flown out for dinner with me in the finished car\n • Partner spotlight this episode: Veteran Lending Group\n • Newsletter sign-up is on the site\n • Send mail to: 101 Oak St. Suite A, PMB 331, Copperas Cove, TX 76522\n\nWant a deeper breakdown on one headline? Go watch my Snapshot Reports.\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nMerchandise and other social links are on my website:\n\nhttps://t.co/x9odPoU53O\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nWebsite Membership: 20% discount on all merchandise, exclusive content, and you can message me directly.\n\nhttps://t.co/4cXJPeOxCS\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nEmail Newsletter:\n\nhttps://t.co/qPF9gd3g8n",
